  "summary": "MATCHBOIL is a custom C# downloader used by the Russia-aligned UAC-0099 group to retrieve a hex-encoded payload from its C&C server over HTTPS, install it under %LOCALAPPDATA% and persist it via Run registry values or scheduled tasks. Between 2024 and 2026 it evolved from a Unicode-obfuscated one-shot downloader into .NET Reactor-obfuscated variants with sandbox checks, a mutex-gated execution argument, a decoy GUI and a two-minute C&C polling timer. This profile captures its install paths, filenames, mutex, HTTP headers, scheduled task names and C&C infrastructure.",
